<title>CHINA: ABN AMRO launched warrants on HK Telecom.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO launched warrants on HK Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Bank N.V. said on Tuesday it launched 117 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$16.605     PREMIUM	   13.18 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.4277     GEARING	   4.31x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  12.JUN.98     EXER LOT	  4,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG     LAUNCH DATE     15.AUG.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$18.45	PAYMENT DATE    01.SEPT.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG     LISTING DATE    04.SEPT.97</p>
<p> NOTE		  CASH SETTLEMENT OR PHYSICAL DELIVERY AT THE</p>
<p> CHOICE OF THE WARRANT ISSUER.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
